770
01:02:12.720 --> 01:02:14.551
I can't swim!

771
01:02:14.920 --> 01:02:15.955
I can't...!

772
01:02:16.040 --> 01:02:17.075
What?

773
01:02:17.680 --> 01:02:19.352
I can't swim.

774
01:02:19.440 --> 01:02:20.714
Shit.

775
